  "label": "Relatable Meme Culture",
  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, internet-savvy audience familiar with 'relatable' humor — people who can easily identify with the universal awkwardness of being interrupted by an urgent bodily need during a conversation. This community values humor derived from shared, mundane experiences and appreciates the use of expressive public figures (like Oprah Winfrey) to amplify relatability.",
